(6624598, 989412, 49018, '<td valign="top">Nice texture and B&amp;W. I am a bit uncertain about the selective desaturation/ hand colouring, even if it helps suggesting the mutual attraction. I wonder if a closer crop might have worked better, at least for me.</td>', 'Nice texture and B&W. I am a bit uncertain about the selective desaturation/ hand colouring, even if it helps suggesting the mutual attraction. I wonder if a closer crop might have worked better, at least for me.', '2011-12-23 19:29:24.000000', NULL, 1),
