(6624608, 988996, 49018, '<td valign="top">Nice candid, very amusing. I am a bit uncertain about the hand made, miniature macro stye, out of focus. Tilt lens outtake? I think a more naturally degrading, perspective based bokeh would have worked better for me, or at least finishing blurring the right hand corner of the image. Now that corner attracts my eye like a magnet. But perhaps that was the intention.</td>', 'Nice candid, very amusing. I am a bit uncertain about the hand made, miniature macro stye, out of focus. Tilt lens outtake? I think a more naturally degrading, perspective based bokeh would have worked better for me, or at least finishing blurring the right hand corner of the image. Now that corner attracts my eye like a magnet. But perhaps that was the intention.', '2011-12-23 19:40:14.000000', NULL, 1),
