(6625315, 989216, 69446, '<td valign="top">Sea and surf go together, I''m marking this one a "4" because the picture doesn''t do much to grab my attention. The reality is, I''m used to seeing surf pictures of guys riding in tubes or of giant waves, so this "modest" surf doesn''t do much to stir the imagination. I hope this feedback helps!</td>', 'Sea and surf go together, I''m marking this one a "4" because the picture doesn''t do much to grab my attention. The reality is, I''m used to seeing surf pictures of guys riding in tubes or of giant waves, so this "modest" surf doesn''t do much to stir the imagination. I hope this feedback helps!', '2011-12-25 20:54:15.000000', NULL, 1),
