(6625322, 988989, 69446, '<td valign="top">Mr Whiskers looks good with the sharpening, but the background bokeh has suffered and isn''t attractive. I think the picture could be improved by applying a nice blur to the background to remove the distracting sharp highlights.</td>', 'Mr Whiskers looks good with the sharpening, but the background bokeh has suffered and isn''t attractive. I think the picture could be improved by applying a nice blur to the background to remove the distracting sharp highlights.', '2011-12-25 21:02:54.000000', NULL, 1),
