(6625325, 989444, 69446, '<td valign="top">Striking photo and well processed. I love the expression on the dog :) The only tiny nitpick I have is where the image is cropped at the top... a fraction more or less leg might have looked better? 9 from me.</td>', 'Striking photo and well processed. I love the expression on the dog :) The only tiny nitpick I have is where the image is cropped at the top... a fraction more or less leg might have looked better? 9 from me.', '2011-12-25 21:06:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(6625326, 989307, 69446, '<td valign="top">The cheese and wine floating in a sea of purple looks a little bit strange, for me... there''s a natural "negative space" in the centre of the image, and the solid wall of purple gives me nothing to focus on here...</td>', 'The cheese and wine floating in a sea of purple looks a little bit strange, for me... there''s a natural "negative space" in the centre of the image, and the solid wall of purple gives me nothing to focus on here...', '2011-12-25 21:07:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(6625328, 989289, 69446, '<td valign="top">Nothing wrong with your idea, the execution looks a little "raw" compared to the competition. For a simple idea like this (milk and cookies), you need a really sharp capture with a clean (almost studio) background or a very creative angle to catch the viewers attention. The chair in the background is a bit distracting and the crop at the top of the milk glass doesn''t come across as intentional. I hope Santa enjoyed his cookies :-)</td>', 'Nothing wrong with your idea, the execution looks a little "raw" compared to the competition. For a simple idea like this (milk and cookies), you need a really sharp capture with a clean (almost studio) background or a very creative angle to catch the viewers attention. The chair in the background is a bit distracting and the crop at the top of the milk glass doesn''t come across as intentional. I hope Santa enjoyed his cookies :-)', '2011-12-25 21:11:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(6625330, 989436, 69446, '<td valign="top">A bit saccharin, for me... a bit of humour would help. Subjective.</td>', 'A bit saccharin, for me... a bit of humour would help. Subjective.', '2011-12-25 21:13:51.000000', NULL, 1),
