(6625333, 989347, 69446, '<td valign="top">Well lit and a nice composition, my only suggestion would be to use a fancier / more attractive pen! Good job overall.</td>', 'Well lit and a nice composition, my only suggestion would be to use a fancier / more attractive pen! Good job overall.', '2011-12-25 21:16:48.000000', NULL, 1),
