(6626886, 989434, 50695, '<td valign="top">the splash is frozen by a fast shutter but the water is smoothed by a slow shutter. The result looks like a localized disturbance of water with no ripples.</td>', 'the splash is frozen by a fast shutter but the water is smoothed by a slow shutter. The result looks like a localized disturbance of water with no ripples.', '2011-12-28 09:46:45.000000', NULL, 1);
