(6627148, 989112, 94265, '<td valign="top">My choice for the blue. It''s a cool mix of interesting, cute and picturesque; a nice quiet farm road, the boys going about their business, the cute as Hell little lambies and all looks great in crisp b&amp;w. Good job. :-)</td>', 'My choice for the blue. It''s a cool mix of interesting, cute and picturesque; a nice quiet farm road, the boys going about their business, the cute as Hell little lambies and all looks great in crisp b&w. Good job. :-)', '2011-12-28 17:09:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(6627149, 989451, 94265, '<td valign="top">Wonderfully sharp, shows off some great detail. Very effective lighting too. There''s only one other shot that I like better than this one, so it''s my pick for the red. Great work! :-)</td>', 'Wonderfully sharp, shows off some great detail. Very effective lighting too. There''s only one other shot that I like better than this one, so it''s my pick for the red. Great work! :-)', '2011-12-28 17:11:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(6627150, 988989, 94265, '<td valign="top">Great clarity and colours, I love how the little fellow is peeking down from the tree. Very nice shot, hope it does well.</td>', 'Great clarity and colours, I love how the little fellow is peeking down from the tree. Very nice shot, hope it does well.', '2011-12-28 17:12:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(6627151, 989420, 94265, '<td valign="top">I like the mellow tones. There''s movement in the shot but it''s also very calm. Interesting!</td>', 'I like the mellow tones. There''s movement in the shot but it''s also very calm. Interesting!', '2011-12-28 17:13:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(6627152, 989061, 94265, '<td valign="top">Very amusing, great bold colours and crisp sharpness, a great shot.</td>', 'Very amusing, great bold colours and crisp sharpness, a great shot.', '2011-12-28 17:13:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(6627153, 989350, 94265, '<td valign="top">An interesting array of shapes and colours, I like it.</td>', 'An interesting array of shapes and colours, I like it.', '2011-12-28 17:14:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(6627154, 989359, 94265, '<td valign="top">Brilliantly crisp; there''s a lot happening in the shot so it''s a bit busy at first glance but on closer inspection, the details are great. Interesting characters, works well in b&amp;w. Very cool overall!</td>', 'Brilliantly crisp; there''s a lot happening in the shot so it''s a bit busy at first glance but on closer inspection, the details are great. Interesting characters, works well in b&w. Very cool overall!', '2011-12-28 17:15:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(6627155, 989306, 94265, '<td valign="top">Perhaps a teeny bit over-denoised/smoothed but still very nice, I like the relaxed colours and the bird is beautiful. I like the bokeh too; nice image.</td>', 'Perhaps a teeny bit over-denoised/smoothed but still very nice, I like the relaxed colours and the bird is beautiful. I like the bokeh too; nice image.', '2011-12-28 17:16:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(6627156, 989412, 94265, '<td valign="top">Not sure I would have gone for selective colour and the thin coloured borders don''t work for me, they kinda pull my eye towards them. Other than that, a lovely sharp image of a great subject, nice tones, made me smile as it looks like one of them is shouting at the other!</td>', 'Not sure I would have gone for selective colour and the thin coloured borders don''t work for me, they kinda pull my eye towards them. Other than that, a lovely sharp image of a great subject, nice tones, made me smile as it looks like one of them is shouting at the other!', '2011-12-28 17:17:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(6627160, 989440, 94265, '<td valign="top">The contrast is a little heavy for me on the sea but that sky is beautiful, I like the faint visible coastline of the hills and smoke towers. The image is thoughtfully sombre.</td>', 'The contrast is a little heavy for me on the sea but that sky is beautiful, I like the faint visible coastline of the hills and smoke towers. The image is thoughtfully sombre.', '2011-12-28 17:19:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(6627161, 989411, 94265, '<td valign="top">This one is amusing; I love the little figurines, their wee outfits and the miniature furniture. I find the vignette a bit distracting though, my eye wants to go to the darkened bottom corners.</td>', 'This one is amusing; I love the little figurines, their wee outfits and the miniature furniture. I find the vignette a bit distracting though, my eye wants to go to the darkened bottom corners.', '2011-12-28 17:20:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(6627164, 989159, 94265, '<td valign="top">Beautiful sky. The person''s jacket is quite eye-grabbing though, I think I''d have desaturated the orange/red coat or waited for them to leave; this image is pretty enough with the title without a person in there.</td>', 'Beautiful sky. The person''s jacket is quite eye-grabbing though, I think I''d have desaturated the orange/red coat or waited for them to leave; this image is pretty enough with the title without a person in there.', '2011-12-28 17:22:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(6627167, 989347, 94265, '<td valign="top">Nice focus and DOF, looks fine technically and certainly fits the challenge; it''s just not a very interesting subject for me personally, as it is. Perhaps a more colourful pen like a bright felt-tip would have brought a little more pop to the shot.</td>', 'Nice focus and DOF, looks fine technically and certainly fits the challenge; it''s just not a very interesting subject for me personally, as it is. Perhaps a more colourful pen like a bright felt-tip would have brought a little more pop to the shot.', '2011-12-28 17:24:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(6627169, 989438, 94265, '<td valign="top">Very eye-catching, good focus on the glass.</td>', 'Very eye-catching, good focus on the glass.', '2011-12-28 17:25:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(6627172, 989437, 94265, '<td valign="top">I really like this shot, it''s quite peaceful, nice texture of the sand on skin too. My only criticism would be that his head is quite block-black right on top, a little more light on there to catch some more detail of the hair would have been good. Very nice shot overall though.</td>', 'I really like this shot, it''s quite peaceful, nice texture of the sand on skin too. My only criticism would be that his head is quite block-black right on top, a little more light on there to catch some more detail of the hair would have been good. Very nice shot overall though.', '2011-12-28 17:26:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(6627177, 989425, 94265, '<td valign="top">Good DOF, nice bokeh on the fire there, for me it makes a nice addition that we can see the fire that melted the marshmallows. Good focus on the crackers in front. I can''t say the snack appeals to me, haha but overall I like this shot.</td>', 'Good DOF, nice bokeh on the fire there, for me it makes a nice addition that we can see the fire that melted the marshmallows. Good focus on the crackers in front. I can''t say the snack appeals to me, haha but overall I like this shot.', '2011-12-28 17:29:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(6627187, 989340, 94265, '<td valign="top">Nice and sharp, good light; I''d have simply titled it ''bullet and gun'' though, as there is nothing in the shot that depicts the ''peace'' part.</td>', 'Nice and sharp, good light; I''d have simply titled it ''bullet and gun'' though, as there is nothing in the shot that depicts the ''peace'' part.', '2011-12-28 17:32:07.000000', NULL, 1),
