(6628369, 989112, 109387, '<td valign="top">I knew it was yours, your B/W are always amazing. For my eyes this scene is not really uncommon (as it could be for many American people here). I live in a region famous for the <i>transumanza</i>, the act of going from a very far place to another with the sheep and you can still see in the mountains some shepherds. This doesn''t change the fact that this picture is absolutely wonderful John!</td>', 'I knew it was yours, your B/W are always amazing. For my eyes this scene is not really uncommon (as it could be for many American people here). I live in a region famous for the transumanza, the act of going from a very far place to another with the sheep and you can still see in the mountains some shepherds. This doesn''t change the fact that this picture is absolutely wonderful John!', '2011-12-30 02:42:47.000000', NULL, 0),
