(6628439, 989385, 137576, '<td valign="top">the drawing was to "sketchify" in photoshop needed to be softer and less a photo and sharp for me, i did not like the tonal difference between the bright "drawing" and the screwed up paper, the discarded paper and pencils have to much of a staged feel, i know it was staged of course but shouldnt feel that way to me. good idea but it didnt wow me, infact i scored it a 4 which may have been harsh but i felt it was a little gimmicky. sorry, but honesty is the best policy Giles.</td>', 'the drawing was to "sketchify" in photoshop needed to be softer and less a photo and sharp for me, i did not like the tonal difference between the bright "drawing" and the screwed up paper, the discarded paper and pencils have to much of a staged feel, i know it was staged of course but shouldnt feel that way to me. good idea but it didnt wow me, infact i scored it a 4 which may have been harsh but i felt it was a little gimmicky. sorry, but honesty is the best policy Giles.', '2011-12-30 04:44:30.000000', NULL, 0),
