(6628467, 989417, 120171, '<td valign="top">I was one of your 5''s for me I thought the sepia colouring was too much and overpowered the shot. The composition was not balanced and everything seems to be up near the camera leaving the back of the shot empty. The vignette also looks blotchy.<br/>5 is my average vote which I use for those that don''t capture my interest.<br/>I''m highlighting the negatives in my opinion as per your request in the forum.<br/>Hope this helps.</td>', 'I was one of your 5''s for me I thought the sepia colouring was too much and overpowered the shot. The composition was not balanced and everything seems to be up near the camera leaving the back of the shot empty. The vignette also looks blotchy.5 is my average vote which I use for those that don''t capture my interest.I''m highlighting the negatives in my opinion as per your request in the forum.Hope this helps.', '2011-12-30 05:39:59.000000', NULL, 0),
