(6628533, 989417, 101702, '<td valign="top">I''m another of your 5''s... like <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=120171" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">Jon_H</a> below, I use that for an average shot that doesn''t grab me. I don''t actually mind the sepia but the splash of green on the coffee pot distracts from that feel so I would have desaturated all colours before adding a sepia tone to it. <br/> <br/>I felt that none of the objects were actually in sharp focus which was a little off-putting - the area with most clarity is the table cloth to the bottom left of the saucer which just felt like the wong place. <br/> <br/>Finally I feel the composition is a little cluttered with the dish and pot behind the cup. It may have been better if they were spread a little more so that each had their own space - the depth of field you chose was good and with a bit of separation between the items would have helped focus the viewer on the main subjects. Central composition doesn''t always work but in this case the cup and saucer would have been fine in the centre providing the other items were more balanced. <br/> <br/>I note you expected a 5.5 but got a 5.9 which isn''t too bad. Hope that helps!</td>', 'I''m another of your 5''s... like  Jon_H below, I use that for an average shot that doesn''t grab me. I don''t actually mind the sepia but the splash of green on the coffee pot distracts from that feel so I would have desaturated all colours before adding a sepia tone to it.  I felt that none of the objects were actually in sharp focus which was a little off-putting - the area with most clarity is the table cloth to the bottom left of the saucer which just felt like the wong place.  Finally I feel the composition is a little cluttered with the dish and pot behind the cup. It may have been better if they were spread a little more so that each had their own space - the depth of field you chose was good and with a bit of separation between the items would have helped focus the viewer on the main subjects. Central composition doesn''t always work but in this case the cup and saucer would have been fine in the centre providing the other items were more balanced.  I note you expected a 5.5 but got a 5.9 which isn''t too bad. Hope that helps!', '2011-12-30 08:33:20.000000', NULL, 0),
(6628535, 989444, 114969, '<td valign="top">Congratulations Johanna, great lighting and very funny. You''re getting really good with pets! Your picture reminds me of <a href="//1x.com/photo/41023" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">that one</a>, maybe next time will you try some exotic animals? :-)</td>', 'Congratulations Johanna, great lighting and very funny. You''re getting really good with pets! Your picture reminds me of that one, maybe next time will you try some exotic animals? :-)', '2011-12-30 08:34:11.000000', NULL, 0),
(6628537, 989444, 19825, '<td valign="top">When I saw this shot in voting I thought, three things that go together: nice legs + cute pet + <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_N.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_N.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_N.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=96751" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">tanguera</a>. Congratulations on another ribbon and a great month. Your work is amazing -- it''s about time more ribbons started coming your way.</td>', 'When I saw this shot in voting I thought, three things that go together: nice legs + cute pet +  tanguera. Congratulations on another ribbon and a great month. Your work is amazing -- it''s about time more ribbons started coming your way.', '2011-12-30 08:46:53.000000', NULL, 0),
