(6628567, 989112, 19825, '<td valign="top">This is such a wonderfully rendered image, and I would have saved your "at the last count" for the Free Study. Such an amazing pair of images. But, I suspect you will have something equally stunning for the FS. Please stop making it look so easy. Congrats on yet another blue this month, and thanks for the many lessons I have taken from you in 2011.</td>', 'This is such a wonderfully rendered image, and I would have saved your "at the last count" for the Free Study. Such an amazing pair of images. But, I suspect you will have something equally stunning for the FS. Please stop making it look so easy. Congrats on yet another blue this month, and thanks for the many lessons I have taken from you in 2011.', '2011-12-30 09:38:00.000000', NULL, 0),
