(6630317, 989312, 63218, '<td valign="top">I am blinded by the light coming off the wall, &amp; the grass looks like it''s under water. As I gaze at that window I start to imagine what might be on the other side, in the musty dusty dark with little beams of light coming thru the holes in the roof. Is it keeping company with the dessicated remains of a poor soul locked in &amp; left to die slowly alone in the dark? Do the locals sometimes see a face at the window, mouth open in a silent scream? Hm?<br/> <br/>And oh...yeah, Wonderful!<br/> <br/>PS, I''m glad you''re still here &amp; entering the occasional challenge.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2012-01-01 16:17:12.</i></td>', 'I am blinded by the light coming off the wall, & the grass looks like it''s under water. As I gaze at that window I start to imagine what might be on the other side, in the musty dusty dark with little beams of light coming thru the holes in the roof. Is it keeping company with the dessicated remains of a poor soul locked in & left to die slowly alone in the dark? Do the locals sometimes see a face at the window, mouth open in a silent scream? Hm? And oh...yeah, Wonderful! PS, I''m glad you''re still here & entering the occasional challenge.', '2012-01-01 16:12:03.000000', '2012-01-01 16:17:12.000000', 0),
